  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hey. Sorry to spring this on you, but I need help\nfinding someone.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002E00200053006F00720072007900200074006F00200073007000720069006E0067002000740068006900730020006F006E00200079006F0075002C0020006200750074002000490020006E006500650064002000680065006C0070000A00660069006E00640069006E006700200073006F006D0065006F006E0065002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m looking for a Trainer who uses Dragon types\nand whose partner is a Dragalge.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This person is tall, has green hair...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200070006500720073006F006E002000690073002000740061006C006C002C002000680061007300200067007200650065006E00200068006100690072002E002E002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "and probably looks pretty wild and tough—like a\nstreet fighter.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0061006E0064002000700072006F006200610062006C00790020006C006F006F006B00730020007000720065007400740079002000770069006C006400200061006E006400200074006F0075006700682014006C0069006B006500200061000A00730074007200650065007400200066006900670068007400650072002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you know anyone who fits that description,\nplease let me know!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F00750020006B006E006F007700200061006E0079006F006E0065002000770068006F00200066006900740073002000740068006100740020006400650073006300720069007000740069006F006E002C000A0070006C00650061007300650020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F0077002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Trainer I’m looking for uses Dragon types and\nhas a Dragalge for a partner.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis person is tall, has green hair, and probably\ndresses like a street fighter.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 168
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you want?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F0075002000770061006E0074003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh... What are you wearing?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068002E002E002E00200057006800610074002000610072006500200079006F0075002000770065006100720069006E0067003F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Who cares what I’m wearing?! It’s none of your\nbusiness! Yeesh, talk about tactless.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guess some things never change... Good to see ya\nagain, Marcia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007500650073007300200073006F006D00650020007400680069006E006700730020006E00650076006500720020006300680061006E00670065002E002E002E00200047006F006F006400200074006F0020007300650065002000790061000A0061006700610069006E002C0020004D00610072006300690061002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon and I have been training tirelessly to\nfinally take you down, Lebanne.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha! Training hard’s a given for any fighter worth\ntheir salt. I’ve gotten stronger too.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I’m counting on it—and I’ll beat you anyway!\nThen you’ll have to make good on your promise!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lebanne. You know that I cannot allow you to\nparticipate in extracurricular, non-SBC activities...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nNot without me, of course!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wha—?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800612014003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve got a score to settle on the battlefield,\nlady—so stay outta the way!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you wish to battle Lebanne, you will need my\npermission to do so.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F00750020007700690073006800200074006F00200062006100740074006C00650020004C006500620061006E006E0065002C00200079006F0075002000770069006C006C0020006E0065006500640020006D0079000A007000650072006D0069007300730069006F006E00200074006F00200064006F00200073006F002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>\nYou have but one option—<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTeam up with <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\nand<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbattle<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nus<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntogether!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 17,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is our responsibility as elites to guide the\nmasses, Clefable!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020006900730020006F0075007200200072006500730070006F006E0073006900620069006C00690074007900200061007300200065006C006900740065007300200074006F0020006700750069006400650020007400680065000A006D00610073007300650073002C00200043006C0065006600610062006C0065002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Time for our secret weapon! Mega Evolve so we\ncan drag these two, Dragalge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You weren’t kidding about all that training, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200077006500720065006E201900740020006B0069006400640069006E0067002000610062006F0075007400200061006C006C0020007400680061007400200074007200610069006E0069006E0067002C0020006800750068003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Told you so! Though I admit this victory was\nlargely thanks to <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006C006400200079006F007500200073006F0021002000540068006F00750067006800200049002000610064006D006900740020007400680069007300200076006900630074006F007200790020007700610073000A006C0061007200670065006C00790020007400680061006E006B007300200074006F00200010000201000000002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Still, a win’s a win and a deal’s a deal. Now you\nhave to fulfill the promise you made.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lebanne—partner with me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500620061006E006E006520140070006100720074006E00650072002000770069007400680020006D0065002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, about that...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C002000610062006F0075007400200074006800610074002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve already got a partner. I’m sorry, but that’s one\npromise I just can’t keep.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And yet you partnered up with Gwynn...or did I\nimagine that?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000790065007400200079006F007500200070006100720074006E0065007200650064002000750070002000770069007400680020004700770079006E006E002E002E002E006F0072002000640069006400200049000A0069006D006100670069006E006500200074006800610074003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I already told you, that was... I did that for Miss\nAnsha’s benefit.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200061006C0072006500610064007900200074006F006C006400200079006F0075002C002000740068006100740020007700610073002E002E002E0020004900200064006900640020007400680061007400200066006F00720020004D006900730073000A0041006E00730068006120190073002000620065006E0065006600690074002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see how it is... Guess I took too long training\nand missed my shot, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No worries. I get it. And Lebanne...that outfit\nlooks good on you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200077006F00720072006900650073002E002000490020006700650074002000690074002E00200041006E00640020004C006500620061006E006E0065002E002E002E00740068006100740020006F00750074006600690074000A006C006F006F006B007300200067006F006F00640020006F006E00200079006F0075002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Thank you for your help,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F007200200079006F00750072002000680065006C0070002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now then, where am I gonna find a good partner?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00770020007400680065006E002C00200077006800650072006500200061006D0020004900200067006F006E006E0061002000660069006E00640020006100200067006F006F006400200070006100720074006E00650072003F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d like a partner I can trust—someone who’s\nready to throw down with me anytime, anywhere.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
